---
source: crates/ostro/tests/cli_p11.rs
expression: "help(&[\"bulk\"])"
---
Rate-limited bulk jobs over a run selection (cancel, terminate, retry, rerun, requeue, pause, resume, signal; ls, status, cancel <JOB>)

Usage: ostro bulk <COMMAND>

Commands:
  cancel     Cancel the selected runs, or (`bulk cancel <JOB>`) cancel a bulk job
  terminate  Terminate the selected runs
  retry      Retry the selected failed runs (resume in place or restart as a new linked run)
  rerun      Rerun the selected runs from a cut
  requeue    Requeue the selected DLQ members
  pause      Pause the selected runs
  resume     Resume the selected paused runs
  signal     Send a signal to the selected runs
  ls         List bulk jobs
  status     Show (or `--watch`) a bulk job's progress
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
